:: MP Ledger Debt More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
账本主册后头还夹着一叠没有编号的补充页，纸色深浅不一。罗宾把它们按日子摊在煤油灯下：第 <<print $mpLedger.week>> 周原额 <<print $mpLedger.amount>> 钱，逾期 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔，保护栏写进 <<print _protCnt>> 人，前面已核销 <<print $mpLedger.paid>> 钱。为了免得夜里翻乱，他把催收、核账与保人名单夹在前半叠，假凭条、旧债主与失窃追查夹在后半叠，最底下压着月末封账页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[翻看前叠催收 (0:03)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看后叠暗账页 (0:03)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub B]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[翻到月末封账结算 (0:04)|MP Ledger Debt Extra Outcome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Debt More Hub A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
前半叠补充页记着三件迫在眉睫的明面交锋：贝利手下的打手拎着账袋提前上门催收，院长室桌上摊开了红杠密布的核账单，保护名单的复核单也到了重签保人的日子。眼下逾期栏记着 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔，保护栏护住 <<print _protCnt>> 人。罗宾把炭条搁在纸堆旁，替你听着门廊外的脚步声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[顶住提前催收 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[进院长室核红杠 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[守住保护名单底页 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Debt More Hub B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
后半叠补充页记着三桩暗里的手脚：火漆只拓出半个印的假凭条底样、拿着十年前发黄借据上门的旧债主，以及趁夜从储煤间被人硬扯走的散页。眼下周债原额 <<print $mpLedger.amount>> 钱，前面已核销 <<print $mpLedger.paid>> 回。罗宾把煤油灯拨亮半分，等你挑一页先料理。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[拓印假火漆票 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[应付上门旧债主 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 5]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[顺煤渣追查失窃页 (0:06)|MP Ledger Debt Extra 6]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Debt Extra 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _due to ($mpLedger.amount or 1500)>>
天刚擦黑，门厅铜环就被两个常跑孤儿院线的打手拍响。他们把提前催收单摊在矮桌上，说本期原额 <<print _due>> 钱、逾期 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔，给一刻钟拿钱或凭条出来，否则就要搬走后厨铁锅与楼上毛毯。罗宾把孩子们护在楼梯口，手一直按在扶手上等你拿主意。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前叠 (0:02)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[当面补五百钱 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($money or 0) gte 500>><<money -500>><<set $mpLedger.paid to (($mpLedger.paid or 0) + 500)>><<set $mpLedger.paidWindow to (($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0) + 500)>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpAlert to Math.max(0, ($mpAlert or 0) - 2)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[塞进一张假凭条 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 230>><<set $mpLedger.paid to (($mpLedger.paid or 0) + (_due or 1500))>><<set $mpLedger.paidWindow to (($mpLedger.paidWindow or 0) + (_due or 1500))>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 4)>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[替打手去码头搬货 (0:14)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><<else>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 4>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Debt Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
核账面摊在院长室桌上，前面已核销 <<print $mpLedger.paid>> 钱，逾期栏圈着 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔，保护栏写进 <<print _protCnt>> 人。贝利手下的老账房戴着铜框眼镜逐行核对红杠，显然把同一笔柴米息钱重复记了两次，还想顺藤摸瓜翻出保护名单的底页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前叠 (0:02)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[当面指认重记 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 220 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁拨算盘抽底页 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 230>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 4)>><<mpalertgain "后窗的插销动了">><<set $mpLedger.amount to Math.max(1500, ($mpLedger.amount or 1500) - 350)>><<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) - 4)>><</if>><<set $mpBaileyBiweeklyNextDay to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0) + 7>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 6)>><<mpalertgain "贝利的人看见后窗开着">><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[咬定数目认下连坐 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.overdue or 0) - 1)>><<pain 2>><<else>><<pain 4>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Debt Extra 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<set _slot to ($mpLedger.protected[0] is 0 ? 0 : ($mpLedger.protected[1] is 0 ? 1 : ($mpLedger.protected[2] is 0 ? 2 : -1)))>>
保护名单复核单压在灯座底下，眼下已护住 <<print _protCnt>> 人，待补的那一格写着<<if _slot is 0>>皮普<<elseif _slot is 1>>克拉拉<<elseif _slot is 2>>托比<<else>>全员在册<</if>>。账房要求今日之内补齐保人签押，否则就把未签押的孩子重新划回抵债劳力栏。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前叠 (0:02)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _slot gte 0>><<mpbargainicon>><<link [[垫钱补齐签押 (0:14)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($money or 0) gte 220>><<money -220>><<mpLedgerProtect _slot>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>><<mpalertgain "代书先生多问了两句">><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[连夜送人进暗格 (0:14)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<if _slot gte 0>><<mpLedgerProtect _slot>><</if>><<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) - 4)>><</if>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 3)>><<mpalertgain "夜路上有人提灯">><<tiredness 3>><<else>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[硬拖复核期换缓冲 (0:12)|MP Ledger Debt More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLedger.overdue to (($mpLedger.overdue or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 4)>><<mpalertgain "账房书记来了两趟">><<if $mpSafehouses and $mpSafehouses.orphanage>><<set $mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk to Math.min(100, ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 20) + 2)>><</if>><<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>><</link>>

