<<walkicon>><<link [[拆账分散保名单 (0:14)|MP Ledger Ending Escape]]>><<pass 14>><</link>><br>
<<link [[进四档连坐问责册 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Transfer 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
保护栏护住两个人后，贝利的拦路马车在多姆斯街暗巷口设了卡，挨辆搜查过往的板车，要把送去安全屋的孩子截回来。<<if ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 4>>浓重的海雾替板车遮住了大半车辙，黑手套只能靠灯影认人。<<else>>夜色清朗，黑手套拿着名单逐辆核对，连车底的夹层也要敲一敲。<</if>>巷口的积水映着马车风灯，你必须在截车前做出决断。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回问责 (0:02)|MP Ledger Punish Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[借暗渠雾道绕卡 (0:14)|MP Ledger Punish Transfer 2]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 200 or ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 4>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[推空车引开黑手套 (0:14)|MP Ledger Punish Transfer 2]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLedgerPChoice to "decoy">><</link>>

:: MP Ledger Punish Transfer 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpLedgerInit>>
<<set $mpLedgerPunishDone_transfer to 1>>
<<set _protCnt to (($mpLedger.protected[0] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[1] or 0) + ($mpLedger.protected[2] or 0))>>
<<if $mpLedgerPChoice is "ok">>
<<tiredness 3>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>>
<<mpalertgain "暗渠口留下了湿脚印">>
你借着雾气把板车推进旧暗渠侧道，等黑手套搜完街面时，两个孩子已经平安进了安全屋后门。这趟夜行耗尽了体力，也没法从账上支取分文。
<<else>>
<<pain 4>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 4>>
<<set $mpAlert to Math.min(100, ($mpAlert or 0) + 2)>>
